  "apiGuideTitle": "Get a TMDB key",
  "@apiGuideTitle": {
    "description": "Konata interface: apiGuideTitle"
  },
  "apiGuideBody": "1. Sign up or sign in at https://www.themoviedb.org/\n\n2. Go to Account settings → API. Use a desktop browser to apply.\n\n3. Enter your details and accept the terms.\n\n4. Return to Konata → TMDB API.\n\n5. Choose Access token for an API Read Access Token, or API Key for an API key. Don’t mix them up.\n\n6. Test the connection, then save. Keys stay in secure storage. Keep them private.\n\nAPI page: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api",
