  "idStepsTitle": "Steps",
  "@idStepsTitle": {
    "description": "Konata interface: idStepsTitle"
  },
  "idSteps": "1. Find the numeric ID in the TMDB page URL. Check the title and type.\n2. Add the tag to the folder name yourself. Konata does not rename your files.\n3. Rescan the folder. To fix an existing match, search and link it on the details page.",
  "@idSteps": {
    "description": "Konata interface: idSteps"
  },
  "idNotesTitle": "Notes",
  "@idNotesTitle": {
    "description": "Konata interface: idNotesTitle"
  },
  "idNotes": "• A working TMDB key and connection are still required.\n• Use S01E01 for episodes and S00E01 for specials. A title ID does not identify episodes.\n• Match the TMDB year, or omit it if unsure.\n• Locked metadata and custom covers stay unchanged.\n• Missing or incomplete entries may need a manual match.",
  "@idNotes": {
    "description": "Konata interface: idNotes"
  },
